
ROTATE TRANSFORM TOP
EDIT MODEL ALL SELECT ALL
ROTATE TRANSFORM LEFT
MODE WORKPLANE_CREATE ; INTERACTIVE BLOCK
MACRO PAUSE "Select the center of the block "


EXPLORER SELECT Workplane "Workplane\#" NEW
MODE WORKPLANE_EDIT START "#"
MODE WORKPLANE_EDIT TWIST Y
MODE WORKPLANE_EDIT TWIST "270"
WPETWIST ACCEPT
MODE WORKPLANE_EDIT TWIST Z
MODE WORKPLANE_EDIT TWIST "-90"

WPETWIST ACCEPT
MODE WORKPLANE_EDIT FINISH ACCEPT
RENAME Workplane "#" "Left View"

ACTIVATE WORKPLANE "#"
ROTATE TRANSFORM TOP
ROTATE TRANSFORM ISO1